department-CM-description = The Command oversees the entire bunker, enforces doctrine, and maintains internal order. Their word is absolute, and their presence alone keeps everyone in line.
department-PC-description = The Peacekeeping Corps protects the bunker, suppresses unrest, and ensures obedience. They are feared more than respected, and they answer only to Command.
department-LI-description = Labor fuels the bunker’s daily survival. Workers maintain machinery, repair infrastructure, and keep the facility from collapsing.
department-MV-description = The Medical Ward tends to the wounded, treats disease, and keeps the bunker alive. Their resources are scarce, and their patience is even scarcer.
department-LB-description = Logistics manages the flow of supplies, parcels, tools, and information. If something moves through the bunker, Logistics knows about it.
department-SD-description = Scrappers venture into the deep waste tunnels to salvage metal, tools, and forgotten machinery. Dangerous, dirty work yet vital for survival.
department-CS-description = The Civic Sector maintains day-to-day life inside the bunker food, trade, grooming, announcements. They keep the bunker human, or at least close enough.
department-UB-description = The Underbelly is the unofficial, unspoken criminal network of the bunker. Whispers, deals, debts, threats all in the shadows.